Description:

JMAP /query and /queryChanges responses follow RFC 8620 more closely.
`total` is only returned when the request sets `calculateTotal`.
Responses no longer echo `filter`, `sort`, `collapseThreads` or `upToId`,
and SearchSnippet/get no longer echoes `filter`.  Mailbox/query returns
`anchorNotFound`, and Mailbox/queryChanges enforces `maxChanges`.


Documentation:

RFC 8620 sections 5.5 and 5.6.


Config changes:

None.


Upgrade instructions:

Clients that read `total` must set `calculateTotal: true`.  Clients that
read the echoed arguments, including result references to `/filter`,
must use the values from their own request instead.


GitHub issue:

None.
